{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document issuing location identifier","Identification of the location at which a document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","UN/LOCODE","Document issuing location name","Name of the location at which a document was issued and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Actual authentication date/time","Date and time when this authentication was actually signed or otherwise authenticated.","Actual authentication location identifier","Identification of the location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Document category code","Code specifying the category of a document.","User code list","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","Consignment amount","Amount declared for customs purposes of those goods in a consignment whether or not they are subject to the same customs procedure, tariff/statistical heading, country information and duty regime.","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Crossing the border transport means name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Departure date/time","Date and time of departure of the means of transport.","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Transitional element","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification type code","Code specifying the commodity classification  (e.g. Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS), Export Control Classification Code (ECCC), UNDG Code list, International Code of Zoological Nomenc).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","DestinationLocation","Details related to the destination location.","Destination country code","Code specifying the country of destination.","Destination country name","Name of the country of destination.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Gross weight","Weight of goods including packing but excluding carrier's equipment.","Tariff/supplementary quantity","Quantity specifying the goods in the unit as required by customs for tariff, statistical, fiscal purposes or as indicated in \"type\".","Invoice","Details related to the information of a commercial invoice.","Invoice identifier","Identification of an invoice by reference number.","Invoice issue date/time","Date and time of issue of an invoice.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Rule of origin code","Code specifying the criterion of determination as to whether a good qualifies as an originating good in accordance with the rules.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Country of origin name","Name of the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Shipping marks","Marks and or numbers on a transport unit or package.","UN/ECE Recommendation 15","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of  the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","Control","Details related to (governmental) examination.","Certifier","Details related to the party which certifies something.","Certifier name","Name of the party who has provided the certification.","Certifying party identifier","Identification of a party which certifies something.","ControlResult","Details related to the outcome of (governmental) examination.","Control result code","Code specifying the results of a control.","UnloadingLocation","Details related to the location at which the goods (i.e., consignment) are unloaded from the active means of transport having been used for their carriage.","Unloading location name","Name of the unloading location, seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which the cargo is to be unloaded from the means of transport having been used for their carriage.","Unloading location identifier","Identification of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are unloaded from the means of transport having been used for their carriage.","UN/LOCODE + User codes","Exporter","Details related to the person/party who makes or on whose behalf an export declaration is made.","Exporter name","Name of the person who makes, or on whose behalf the export declaration is made, and who is the owner of the goods or has similar right of disposal over them at the time when the declaration is accepted.","Exporter identifier","Identification of the party who makes, or on whose behalf the export declaration is made, and who is the owner of the goods or has similar rights of disposal over them at the time when the declaration is accepted."],"root":{